{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"19425","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/19425","key":"MC-270852","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"16/Apr/24 10:55 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>When the player shoots a projectile at a closed shulker or a breeze from a distance of 1-3 blocks away, the projectile will almost instantly be deflected at the camera's position, never getting near the entity.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a>Steps to Reproduce:</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Summon a shulker with no AI:\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/summon minecraft:shulker ~ ~ ~ {NoAI:1b}\n</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Fire an arrow at it from 1-3 blocks away<br>\n → observe result</li>\n\t<li>Fire an arrow at it from &gt;=4.5 blocks away<br>\n→ observe result</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a>Observed Behavior:</h3>\n<p>When firing it from a closer distance, the arrow will almost instantly be deflected at the camera position, and the player's view will be visually cluttered from all the arrow and particles created. The arrow will also not damage the player due to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"MC-125936\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-125936\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"When projectiles spawn inside a hitbox, they don't hit the hitbox of the entity they are inside\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-125936\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Reopened</span>\n            </span>\n and/or \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"MC-214546\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-214546\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Projectiles (including arrows) sometimes pass through entities without hitting them\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-214546\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Reopened</span>\n            </span>\n. When attempting this same issue with breezes, the behavior is less noticable comparatively (shown in the video/s)</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a>Expected Behavior:</h3>\n<p>The arrow would get near the shulker's hitbox before being deflected properly at close distances just as it does from further away.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Screenshots%2FVideos%3A\"></a>Screenshots/Videos:</h3>\n<p>Reproducing the issue from a third-person perspective:<br>\n <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/35041\" title=\"ShulkerDeflectClose1.mp4 attached to MC-270852\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"ShulkerDeflectClose1.mp4\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"3f0af2b0-c09a-400d-8452-e59edbc044f4\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ShulkerDeflectClose1.mp4<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> <br>\n <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/35042\" title=\"ShulkerDeflectClose2.mp4 attached to MC-270852\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"ShulkerDeflectClose2.mp4\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"3a50ff13-f6ca-48fa-b619-7f65da7cbc6e\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ShulkerDeflectClose2.mp4<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> </p>\n\n<p>Reproducing the issue in first person:<br>\n<span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/35043\" title=\"ShulkerDeflectClosePlayerView.mp4 attached to MC-270852\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"ShulkerDeflectClosePlayerView.mp4\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"02675d2f-9103-480e-9994-ecc56501accb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ShulkerDeflectClosePlayerView.mp4<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span></p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Apr/24 11:01 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/35038","id":"35038","filename":"2024-04-28_16-08-41.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/62daf5e45eeecd39350a78a4/375b1309-50df-4bee-9c64-92412e684e27/32"},"displayName":"[Mod] Jingy","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Chicago","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"28/Apr/24 2:09 PM","size":"8.56 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/35038"},{"sel